sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Service
    participant R as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Admin,DB: ━━━ 部门创建 ━━━
    Admin->>FE: 填写部门表单 → 提交
    FE->>H: POST /api/departments
    H->>H: auth.require_permission("departments:create")
    H->>S: create_department(req)
    S->>R: create(pool, req)
    R->>DB: INSERT INTO departments ...
    DB-->>FE: { data: DepartmentResponse }

    Note over Admin,DB: ━━━ 部门删除（有用户时拒绝）━━━
    Admin->>FE: 点击删除
    FE->>H: DELETE /api/departments/{id}
    H->>S: delete_department(id)
    S->>R: count_users_by_department(id)
    R->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users WHERE department_id=$1
    alt count > 0
        S-->>FE: 400 "该部门下有用户，请先转移用户"
    else count == 0
        S->>R: delete(pool, id)
        R->>DB: DELETE FROM departments WHERE id=$1
        DB-->>FE: { message: "Department deleted" }
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: ━━━ 字典公共查询 ━━━
    FE->>H: GET /api/dicts/{code}
    H->>H: require_auth (仅需登录)
    H->>S: get_dict_by_code(code)
    S->>R: find_active_items_by_code(pool, code)
    R->>DB: SELECT di.label, di.value FROM dict_items di JOIN dict_types dt ON ... WHERE dt.code=$1 AND di.status='active'
    DB-->>FE: { data: [{label, value}] }

    Note over Admin,DB: ━━━ 登录日志记录 ━━━
    actor User
    User->>H: POST /api/auth/login
    H->>H: 提取 IP + User-Agent
    H->>S: login(db, ..., ip, ua)
    S->>S: 校验密码
    S->>R: insert_login_log(event, ip, ua, browser, os, ...)
    R->>DB: INSERT INTO login_logs ...
    DB-->>User: TokenResponse / 401

    Note over Admin,DB: ━━━ 用户导入 ━━━
    Admin->>FE: 上传 xlsx
    FE->>H: POST /api/users/import (multipart)
    H->>S: import_users(pool, xlsx_bytes)
    S->>S: calamine 解析 xlsx
    loop 逐行
        S->>S: 校验邮箱/角色
        S->>S: 生成随机密码
        S->>R: create_user(must_change_password=true)
        R->>DB: INSERT INTO users ...
    end
    S-->>FE: { data: ImportResult }
